  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Package renamed: the package id is now LondonDataServices.OlidsToFhirMapper.STU3 (was LondonDataServices.OlidsToFhirMapper.R3). Consumers must swap their PackageReference rather than bump a version. The projects and namespaces are renamed from R3 to STU3 to match the Hl7.Fhir.STU3 version they target.\n\t\t  - Medication: MedicationStatement carries the last issue date.\n\t\t  - Integration tests: map real development mart records through the mapper.\n\t\t  - Dependencies: Hl7.Fhir.STU3 6.6.0, Microsoft.Extensions.Configuration packages, xunit.v3 4.0.2 and xunit.runner.visualstudio 4.0.1.",
